the constraints `k ≳ D^{2(1−2α)}` and `k·d^τ = O(D^α)` are compatible iff
`(2+τ)(1−2α) ≤ α`, i.e. `α ≥ (2+τ)/(5+2τ)`; at `τ = 0` this is `α ≥ 2/5`. -/
theorem size_model_floor (τ α : ℝ) (hτ : 0 ≤ τ) :
    ((2 + τ) * (1 - 2 * α) ≤ α ↔ (2 + τ) / (5 + 2 * τ) ≤ α) ∧
      ((2 : ℝ) * (1 - 2 * α) ≤ α ↔ 2 / 5 ≤ α) := by
  sorry

