/-- MAIN. [pp] Theorem thm:DL, assembly step: with `B = L^a`, if the expected time is
`≤ (M_rows C_trial + T_post)/p` with `M_rows ≤ L^{a+o(1)}`, `C_trial ≤ L^{max(1/√2, θ/(2a))+o(1)}`,
