   **Fix:** require a genuinely large domain, such as \(x\ge e^e\), and \(U_0\ge3\), or introduce separate large-\(x\) and large-\(u\) thresholds. Adding merely `x > 0`, or even `x > e`, is insufficient. The intended source is the [CEP corollary following Theorem 3.1](https://math.dartmouth.edu/~carlp/PDF/paper39.pdf).

